{"id": "DfPcm_0xE9p", "title": "Video by astro_zova", "description": "भीम एक पूँछ नहीं उठा पाए… 😳\n\n10,000 हाथियों का बल, और एक बूढ़े वानर की पूँछ एक इंच भी नहीं हिली।\nजानते हैं वो वानर कौन था? 🙏\n\nवो थे स्वयं हनुमान जी, पवनपुत्र, भीम के बड़े भाई।\n\nसीख: सच्ची शक्ति शरीर में नहीं, विनम्रता में होती है। 💪\n\n💬 कमेंट में लिखिए \"जय बजरंगबली\"\n📌 Save करें, मंगलवार को किसी को भेजें\n\n🔮 अपनी दैनिक कुंडली देखें: zovaastro.in\n\n#hanumanansh #bhima #jaibajrangbali #ʜᴀɴᴜᴍᴀɴᴊɪ #mahabharat #pandavas #hindumythology #sańatandharma #mythologystories #bajrangbali #pawanputra #reelsındia #bhaktireels", "channel": "astro_zova", "uploader_id": "29969741716", "uploader": "Zova Astro", "timestamp": 1793627312, "like_count": 3, "comment_count": 7, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1504510841730703a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 77.475, "asr": 96000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPSWyurhVnrMqeEJjuvgH6H6t2EUuUWbRfUc7PLOtkzSiOC1JhaZGibJJ1DN7RqbqQE0aWOOKJ0NP0mha90ncYzvl0TMReER1sUrIA.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Adque6IH1Ebiu96PLoVILwuzeJpPI4UyZ9W6f4FP8DtM27aWgAwPg4iaddkvpyOaPxnn3Y79gxYwdKqBaQpaBa5Y&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=a6Fp5KoKwjEQ7kNvwEPWQ8t&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Kww6V0xJiWd9Ed5mb0H4UQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQPsgwC64S-awDqgCw-26zvC4Qf9mncNpdd-lbZvsWR1w&oe=6AF42E6C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 77.475, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www